---
/**
 * Hero section: large headline + subheadline.
 */
---

<section class="hero max-w-4xl m-auto animate-enter">
  <h1 class="hero__headline text-taupe-950 text-balance transition">
    Hi, I'm Jake. <br />
    <span class="text-taupe-500">I'm a </span>product designer <span
      class="text-taupe-500">based in</span
    >
    <span class="text-green-700">Philadelphia</span>, Pennsylvania.
  </h1>
  <p
    class="hero__subheadline md:text-xl text-taupe-500 pt-8 leading-relaxed text-pretty py-12"
  >
    I design digital products with a focus on clarity, systems, and making
    complex experiences feel intuitive.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem) 0;
  }

  .hero__headline {
    font-family: "Fraunces Variable", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-variation-settings:
      "WONK" 0,
      "SOFT" 100;
    font-optical-sizing: auto;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, calc(1.091rem + 4.545dvw), 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .hero__subheadline a {
    color: var(--color-green-700);
    text-decoration-thickness: 0.2ex;
    text-underline-offset: 0.15ex;
  }
</style>
